[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18780.868, "timestamp": "05:13:00", "text": "对此感到懊悔，而且死后感觉很糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18784.99, "timestamp": "05:13:04", "text": "决定是因为我想得到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18786.11, "timestamp": "05:13:06", "text": "雷电"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18788.83, "timestamp": "05:13:08", "text": "避而远之，但即使花了钱，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18790.67, "timestamp": "05:13:10", "text": "并非只有一种方法可以画出你的目标"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18792.948, "timestamp": "05:13:12", "text": "把她弄出去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18796.51, "timestamp": "05:13:16", "text": "但是，不幸的是，V 一个不幸的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18799.548, "timestamp": "05:13:19", "text": "真希望我最终能得到她，我当时真的很难过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18803.548, "timestamp": "05:13:23", "text": "虽然我是H，但我本应该是S。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18809.11, "timestamp": "05:13:29", "text": "开心的时候我好难过，因为就像……我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18813.628, "timestamp": "05:13:33", "text": "我把所有积蓄都花在了那件事上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18816.91, "timestamp": "05:13:36", "text": "我得到了她，但我并没有得到她。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18821.11, "timestamp": "05:13:41", "text": "想要，而且感觉就像我感觉呃，来自个人简介"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18823.948, "timestamp": "05:13:43", "text": "那里"}]